WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.332 --> 00:00:05.665 line:90%
OBI WAN: <i>The force
is what gives a Jedi his power.</i>

00:00:06.318 --> 00:00:08.963 line:90%
<i>It's an energy field created by
all living things.</i>

00:00:08.963 --> 00:00:13.775 line:90%
<i>It surrounds us and penetrates us.
It binds the galaxy together.</i>

00:00:16.106 --> 00:00:18.172 line:90%
MACE WINDU:
<i>You refer to the prophecy of the one</i>

00:00:18.172 --> 00:00:19.754 line:90%
<i>who will balance to the force.</i>

00:00:21.292 --> 00:00:22.988 line:90%
<i>You believe it's this boy?</i>

00:00:27.805 --> 00:00:32.461 line:90%
OBI WAN: <i>Before the dark times,
a young Jedi named Darth Vader,</i>

00:00:33.034 --> 00:00:35.484 line:90%
<i>who was a pupil of mine
until he turned to evil.</i>

00:00:36.507 --> 00:00:39.883 line:90%
<i>Vader was seduced by the dark side
of the force.</i>

00:00:40.416 --> 00:00:43.032 line:90%
Anakin! You were the chosen one!

00:00:43.032 --> 00:00:44.713 line:90%
(LIGHT SABERS CLASHING)

00:00:48.063 --> 00:00:49.724 line:90%
(HEART BEATING)

00:00:50.424 --> 00:00:56.169 line:90%
(MECHANICAL BREATHING)

00:01:00.659 --> 00:01:05.612 line:90%
PALPATINE: Once more
the Sith will rule the galaxy.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:08.714 line:90%
(LIGHT SABER BUZZING)

00:01:12.463 --> 00:01:16.349 line:90%
(LIGHT SABERS BUZZING)

00:01:19.930 --> 00:01:22.775 line:90%
DODONNA: <i>A precise hit will start
a chain reaction which should</i>

00:01:22.775 --> 00:01:24.878 line:90%
destroy the station.
Then man your ships

00:01:24.878 --> 00:01:26.349 line:90%
<i>and may the force be with you.</i>

00:01:26.349 --> 00:01:29.293 line:90%
We will then crush the rebellion
with one swift stroke.

00:01:32.877 --> 00:01:34.527 line:90%
HAN SOLO: Chewy, get us out of here!

00:01:38.657 --> 00:01:40.287 line:90%
OBI WAN: <i>Use the force, Luke.</i>

00:01:41.124 --> 00:01:42.419 line:90%
VADER: <i>I have you now.</i>

00:01:48.704 --> 00:01:50.714 line:90%
OBI WAN: <i>You must learn the ways
of the force.</i>

00:01:51.395 --> 00:01:52.511 line:90%
ANAKIN: <i>I’m not afraid.</i>

00:01:54.161 --> 00:01:57.540 line:90%
OBI WAN: <i>You will be. You will be.</i>

00:01:58.307 --> 00:02:02.709 line:90%
<i>One thing remains.
You must confront Vader.</i>

00:02:03.166 --> 00:02:07.310 line:90%
VADER: <i>You don't know the power
of the dark side.</i>

00:02:07.432 --> 00:02:08.432 line:90%
(LIGHT SABER BUZZING)

00:02:10.715 --> 00:02:14.924 line:90%
<i>If you will not fight,
then you will meet your destiny.</i>

00:02:20.128 --> 00:02:23.399 line:90%
I am a Jedi...like my father before me.

00:02:30.403 --> 00:02:31.403 line:90%
Ben!

00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:40.883 line:90%
(LIGHT SABERS CLASHING)

00:02:43.218 --> 00:02:45.039 line:90%
OBI WAN: <i>That boy is our last hope.</i>

00:02:45.582 --> 00:02:48.495 line:90%
YODA: <i>No. There is another.</i>

